## Why This Is Asked
This question probes end-to-end expertise in multi-tenant LLM ops: model lifecycle management, policy per tenant, data locality, drift auditing, and rollback safety under load.

## Key Concepts
- Cross-tenant orchestration and isolation
- Hot-swappable model variants and feature flags
- Region-pinned data caches and locality guarantees
- Drift auditing, tamper-evident logging, rollback mechanisms

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example swap function
async function swapModelForTenant(tenantId, newVersion) {
  await lockTenant(tenantId);
  await updatePolicy(tenantId, { modelVersion: newVersion });
  await migrateRouter(tenantId);
  logSwap(tenantId, newVersion);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you test rollback and audit integrity under failure?
- How would you handle regional failover while preserving isolation?

