## Why This Is Asked
This question probes practical data provenance and tamper detection in multi-tenant LLM gateways.

## Key Concepts
- Data provenance and tamper-evident logging
- Per-tenant keys and HMAC signing
- Privacy-aware logging and redaction
- Simple retention and rotation policies

## Code Example
```javascript
const crypto = require('crypto');
function signLogLine(line, key){
  const h = crypto.createHmac('sha256', key);
  h.update(line);
  return h.digest('hex');
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
